.TH HOPASH-PROXY-SELECT 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.0" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-proxy\-select \- Select one Node in a Proxy Group
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash proxy select\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIGROUP\fR> <\fINODE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select one Node in a Proxy Group
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIGROUP\fR>
Opaque Proxy Group ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
.TP
<\fINODE\fR>
Source\-aware Node ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
